{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to arrange a session, try the Session Planner, or start a 7‑day habit challenge with {{BUSINESS_NAME}}.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#FBF6F1; /* sand */
      --accent:#8B5E3C; /* warm clay */
      --accent-2:#6B8A56; /* muted olive */
      --muted:#7B6D65;
      --card:#FFF;
      --radius:12px;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --mono: 12px/1.4 system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;color:var(--accent-2);background:var(--bg);}
    body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:28px;}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;width:100%;}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 6px 26px}
    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:0.4px}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(139,94,60,0.06),rgba(107,138,86,0.03));border-radius:16px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    .hero .left{flex:1}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:20px;color:var(--accent)}
    .hero p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
    .connect-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(45,35,25,0.06)}
    label{display:block;margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    input[type=text], input[type=email], textarea, select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #E6DFD9;background:transparent;margin-top:6px;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:92px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .small{flex:1}
    button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700}
    button.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid #E9E1D9;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Session Planner styles */
    .planner h3,.habit h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--accent-2)}
    .planner .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
    .chip{padding:6px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(139,94,60,0.06),rgba(107,138,86,0.04));border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);font-size:13px}
    .summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, #FBFAF9);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed #EEE;margin-top:12px;font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, 'Roboto Mono', monospace;font-size:13px}
    .tools{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}

    /* Habit builder */
    .days{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    .day{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #EEE;background:var(--glass)}
    .print-area{display:none}
    @media print{body *{visibility:hidden} .print-area, .print-area *{visibility:visible} .print-area{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:100%}}

    footer{margin-top:18px;padding:26px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Approach</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Rhythm</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Voices</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero card">
      <div class="left">
        <h1>Connect & plan</h1>
        <p class="muted">A quiet page to arrange a conversation or sketch a clear plan. Use the Session Planner to shape sessions and the 7‑day challenge to start a gentle habit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:right">
        <div class="muted">Ready to begin?</div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px">
          <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="primary" style="text-decoration:none">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <main class="connect-grid">
      <div>
        <section class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Message</h3>
          <p class="muted">Send a note about what you want to focus on. I’ll reply with options for a first conversation and next steps.</p>

          <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return false;">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name">

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com">

            <label for="note">A short note</label>
            <textarea id="note" name="note" placeholder="What would you like to address in our work?"></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px">
              <button class="primary" onclick="submitContact()">Send message</button>
              <button class="ghost" onclick="document.getElementById('contactForm').reset()">Clear</button>
            </div>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">I aim to reply within 48 hours. No medical advice — practical outcomes, habits, and frameworks tailored to you.</p>
          </form>
        </section>

        <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <div class="planner">
            <h3>Session Planner</h3>
            <p class="muted">Quickly assemble a short plan for the coming weeks. Export a plain summary to share or save.</p>

            <label for="clientName">Name for plan</label>
            <input id="clientName" placeholder="Client or your name">

            <label for="goal">Primary outcome</label>
            <input id="goal" placeholder="Example: steady morning energy, clearer evenings">

            <div class="row" style="margin-top:6px">
              <div class="small">
                <label for="length">Session length (min)</label>
                <select id="length">
                  <option>30</option>
                  <option selected>45</option>
                  <option>60</option>
                  <option>90</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="small">
                <label for="frequency">Sessions / week</label>
                <select id="frequency">
                  <option>1</option>
                  <option selected>2</option>
                  <option>3</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <label for="weeks">Weeks</label>
            <select id="weeks">
              <option>2</option>
              <option selected>4</option>
              <option>8</option>
            </select>

            <label>Focus areas</label>
            <div class="chips">
              <button class="chip" data-focus="breath">Breath</button>
              <button class="chip" data-focus="movement">Movement</button>
              <button class="chip" data-focus="reflection">Reflection</button>
              <button class="chip" data-focus="sleep">Sleep cues</button>
              <button class="chip" data-focus="nutrition">Simple food steps</button>
            </div>

            <label for="notesPlanner">Notes / priorities</label>
            <textarea id="notesPlanner" placeholder="Add constraints, preferences, or things to avoid"></textarea>

            <div class="tools">
              <button class="primary" onclick="buildPlan()">Build plan</button>
              <button class="ghost" onclick="clearPlan()">Reset</button>
              <button class="ghost" onclick="copyPlan()">Copy summary</button>
            </div>

            <div id="planSummary" class="summary" aria-live="polite">Your plan will appear here.</div>
          </div>
        </section>


        <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <div class="habit">
            <h3>7‑Day Habit Challenge</h3>
            <p class="muted">Generate a printable checklist to test a habit for a week. Keep it small. Repeat as needed.</p>

            <label for="habitName">Habit</label>
            <input id="habitName" placeholder="E.g., 5 minutes journaling, 10-minute walk">

            <div class="row">
              <div class="small">
                <label for="habitDuration">Daily target</label>
                <input id="habitDuration" placeholder="5 min, 10 reps, etc.">
              </div>
              <div class="small">
                <label for="difficulty">Difficulty</label>
                <select id="difficulty">
                  <option>Easy</option>
                  <option selected>Moderate</option>
                  <option>Challenging</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <label for="startDay">Start day</label>
            <select id="startDay">
              <option>Sunday</option>
              <option>Monday</option>
              <option selected>Today</option>
            </select>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
              <button class="primary" onclick="makeChallenge()">Make checklist</button>
              <button class="ghost" onclick="printChallenge()">Print</button>
              <button class="ghost" onclick="copyChallenge()">Copy text</button>
            </div>

            <div id="challengeArea" style="margin-top:12px">
              <!-- generated checklist appears here -->
            </div>

          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

      <aside>
        <section class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Quick details</h3>
          <p class="muted">Prefer a direct booking? Use the Book page. For immediate queries: <br><strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> <br>or <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="muted">Location</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700;margin-top:6px">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Session types</h3>
          <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Tailored sessions combining short practices, reflective prompts, and practical habit steps. Sample frames:</div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <div class="muted">Pulse Session — 45 min</div>
            <div class="muted" style="opacity:0.9">Single focus, simple takeaways.</div>
            <div style="height:8px"></div>
            <div class="muted">Practice Strand — 4 sessions</div>
            <div class="muted" style="opacity:0.9">A short sequence of sessions to embed one habit.</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Practical note</h3>
          <p class="muted">Work focuses on outcomes, small habit experiments, and clear frameworks. Not medical advice.</p>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3 style="margin:0;color:var(--accent)">Frequently asked</h3>
      <div style="margin-top:10px" class="muted">
        <strong>How long before I see change?</strong>
        <div style="margin-top:6px">Small changes can be felt within a week when practiced deliberately. Substantial shifts come from repeated cycles of experiment + reflection.</div>
        <div style="height:8px"></div>
        <strong>Can I switch focus mid‑program?</strong>
        <div style="margin-top:6px">Yes. We keep sessions flexible and adjust habits and tasks to what materializes as most useful.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div class="muted">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · For scheduling use the Book page or write to <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <!-- printable area used by printChallenge() -->
  <div id="printRoot" class="print-area" style="padding:18px;background:#fff"></div>

  <script>
    // Small helpers
    function $(id){return document.getElementById(id)}

    // Contact form mock
    function submitContact(){
      var name = $('name').value || 'Friend';
      var email = $('email').value || '{{EMAIL}}';
      var note = $('note').value || '(no note)';
      alert('Message sent — a mock confirmation. Thank you, '+name+'.');
      document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
    }

    // Session Planner logic
    (function(){
      var active = new Set();
      document.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach(function(b){
        b.addEventListener('click',function(e){
          var k = e.target.getAttribute('data-focus');
          if(active.has(k)){active.delete(k); e.target.style.opacity=0.6}
          else{active.add(k); e.target.style.opacity=1}
        });
      });
      window.buildPlan = function(){
        var who = $('clientName').value || 'Client';
        var goal = $('goal').value || 'A clearer, repeatable habit';
        var length = $('length').value;
        var freq = parseInt($('frequency').value,10);
        var weeks = parseInt($('weeks').value,10);
        var notes = $('notesPlanner').value || '';
        var focus = Array.from(active);
        if(focus.length===0) focus = ['movement','reflection'];

        var sessionsTotal = freq * weeks;
        var planLines = [];
        planLines.push(who + ' — Session plan');
        planLines.push('Outcome: ' + goal);
        planLines.push('Frame: '+ length + ' min • ' + freq + 'x / week • ' + weeks + ' weeks ('+sessionsTotal+' sessions)');
        planLines.push('\nFocus areas: ' + focus.join(', '));
        planLines.push('\nWeekly sketch:');

        for(var w=1; w<=weeks; w++){
          planLines.push(' Week ' + w + ':');
          for(var s=1;s<=freq;s++){
            var seq = ((w-1)*freq)+s;
            planLines.push('  • Session ' + seq + ' — '+length+'min: brief check-in, one short practice ('+focus[(seq-1)%focus.length]+'), and a simple habit task');
          }
        }

        planLines.push('\nHabits to try (compact):');
        planLines.push(' • 3-min morning anchor (breath or journaling)');
        planLines.push(' • End-of-day reflection: note one small win');

        if(notes) {
          planLines.push('\nNotes: ' + notes);
        }

        planLines.push('\nShareable summary generated by {{BUSINESS_NAME}}');
        var text = planLines.join('\n');
        $('planSummary').textContent = text;
      }
      window.clearPlan = function(){
        $('clientName').value=''; $('goal').value=''; $('notesPlanner').value=''; $('planSummary').textContent='Your plan will appear here.'; active.clear(); document.querySelectorAll('.chip').forEach(function(b){b.style.opacity=1});
      }
      window.copyPlan = function(){
        var txt = $('planSummary').textContent || '';
        navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(function(){
          alert('Plan copied to clipboard');
        }, function(){ alert('Copy failed — select and press Cmd/Ctrl+C') });
      }
    })();

    // Habit challenge logic
    (function(){
      var dayNames = ['Sunday','Monday','Tuesday','Wednesday','Thursday','Friday','Saturday','Sunday'];
      window.makeChallenge = function(){
        var name = $('habitName').value || 'New habit';
        var target = $('habitDuration').value || 'small step';
        var diff = $('difficulty').value;
        var start = $('startDay').value;
        var content = [];
        content.push(name + ' — 7‑day challenge');
        content.push('Target: ' + target + ' • Difficulty: ' + diff);
        content.push('');

        // find index of start day
        var idx = dayNames.indexOf(start);
        if(idx===-1) idx = new Date().getDay(); // if 'Today' shows as Today, fallback
        // handle 'Today' option
        if(start.toLowerCase()==='today') idx = new Date().getDay();

        var checklist = [];
        for(var d=0; d<7; d++){
          var dayLabel = dayNames[(idx + d)%7];
          checklist.push({day: dayLabel, checked:false});
          content.push('[ ] ' + dayLabel + ' — ' + target);
        }

        // render checklist area
        var out = document.createElement('div');
        out.innerHTML = '';
        var grid = document.createElement('div'); grid.className='days';
        checklist.forEach(function(it,i){
          var card = document.createElement('label'); card.className='day';
          var cb = document.createElement('input'); cb.type='checkbox'; cb.style.marginRight='8px'; cb.id='chk_'+i;
          var span = document.createElement('span'); span.textContent = it.day + ' — ' + target;
          card.appendChild(cb); card.appendChild(span);
          grid.appendChild(card);
        });
        out.appendChild(grid);

        var meta = document.createElement('div'); meta.style.marginTop='10px'; meta.className='muted'; meta.textContent='Keep each day small and specific. Check off the box when done.';
        out.appendChild(meta);

        // attach export text
        var exportBox = document.createElement('pre'); exportBox.style.background='#FBFAF9'; exportBox.style.padding='10px'; exportBox.style.borderRadius='8px'; exportBox.style.marginTop='10px'; exportBox.style.fontFamily='ui-monospace, monospace'; exportBox.textContent = content.join('\n');
        out.appendChild(exportBox);

        $('challengeArea').innerHTML=''; $('challengeArea').appendChild(out);

        // prepare print root
        var printRoot = document.getElementById('printRoot');
        printRoot.innerHTML = '<h2>'+name+' — 7‑day checklist</h2>' + '<p>'+target+' • '+diff+'</p>' + '<ol>' + checklist.map(function(it){return '<li>'+it.day+' — '+target+'</li>'}).join('') + '</ol>';
      }
      window.printChallenge = function(){
        var pr = document.getElementById('printRoot');
        if(!pr.innerHTML.trim()){ makeChallenge(); }
        setTimeout(function(){ window.print(); }, 120);
      }
      window.copyChallenge = function(){
        var area = document.querySelector('#challengeArea pre');
        if(area){ navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(area.textContent).then(function(){ alert('Checklist copied') }, function(){ alert('Copy failed') }) }
        else alert('Create the checklist first');
      }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and usage notes for the wellness_coach site (chunk 4).

Files in this bundle:
- contact.html — The site Contact page with two interactive features:
  1) Session Planner — build a compact session plan by entering name, outcome, session length, frequency, weeks, and focus areas. The planner builds a plaintext summary you can copy.
  2) 7‑Day Habit Challenge — create a short daily habit checklist for seven days. The generator renders a checklist, a text export, and prepares a printable version (use your browser Print to produce a paper copy).

Placeholders to replace:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

How to use the interactive widgets:
- Session Planner:
  • Fill the fields (name, outcome, session length, sessions per week, weeks).
  • Click focus chips to include them in the plan.
  • Press Build plan to generate a full plaintext plan in the summary area.
  • Copy summary copies the plan text to the clipboard.

- 7‑Day Habit Challenge:
  • Provide a habit name and daily target.
  • Choose a start day (or Today) and a difficulty.
  • Make checklist builds the interactive checklist and a text export box.
  • Print uses the browser print dialog and shows only the printable checklist.
  • Copy text copies the checklist text to clipboard.

Notes and constraints:
- All features are local JavaScript — no external services or APIs.
- No images or external fonts are used. The page references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for background continuity in other chunks; the Contact page works without it.
- The copy/print features use the Clipboard API and window.print(). Some browsers require secure context for clipboard write; fallback messages are provided.
- Content avoids medical claims and focuses on outcomes, habits, and frameworks.

Integration tips:
- Replace placeholders with real values before deploying.
- Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists in your project root (created in another chunk of the project) or remove references if unused.
- The navigation uses eight links matching the site pages: index.html, about.html, services.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html, contact.html.

If you need a variant with a different tone, layout tweaks, or a downloadable text file export (instead of copy), ask for a quick update."}
BUNDLE_END
